      "bullets": [
        "OpenAI users report the 'allow training' toggle silently resets to enabled, risking unintended prompt ingestion for future model iterations.",
        "Security teams must treat consumer UI privacy toggles as fragile, as inadvertent resets expose proprietary code and internal data.",
        "Organizations requiring strict data isolation should prioritize OpenAI API endpoints or Enterprise agreements where training is excluded by default."
